      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OSHLEY (9) settled handy and finished well for second when resuming in a Breeders Challenge heat at Newcastle last start, beaten a head. Smart filly who will be fitter and is very well placed in this line-up. THE ATTRACTOR (8) finished sixth last start over 1740m at Riverina Paceway, beaten 19 metres, after scoring at the previous appearance over 1740m at Riverina Paceway. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. WAT ON EARTH (5) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when fifth at Eugowra over 2100m. Must be included. SUMMER PUNCH (4) is in the mix following a fifth at her most recent appearance over 1770m at this track.",
